<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LE HAVRE SIGN ENGLISH STRIKER ON LOAN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LE HAVRE SIGN ENGLISH STRIKER ON LOAN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French first division club Le Havre have signed English striker Chris Kiwomya from Arsenal on loan for six months with an option for a full transfer.</p>
<p>Kiwomya, 27, played 210 league matches and scored 51 goals for Ipswich Town before his transfer to Arsenal last year. He made only 14 league appearances for the London club.</p>
